# Project-level forceignore for Salesforce CLI deployments.

# UI bundle development artifacts — only `dist/` (the built output) ships with the UIBundle metadata.
**/uiBundles/**/node_modules/
**/uiBundles/**/src/
**/uiBundles/**/api/
**/uiBundles/**/e2e/
**/uiBundles/**/scripts/
**/uiBundles/**/vercel.json
**/uiBundles/**/.vercel/
**/uiBundles/**/.vite/
**/uiBundles/**/coverage/
**/uiBundles/**/.turbo/
**/uiBundles/**/package.json
**/uiBundles/**/package-lock.json
**/uiBundles/**/tsconfig.json
**/uiBundles/**/tsconfig.node.json
**/uiBundles/**/vite.config.ts
**/uiBundles/**/vitest.config.ts
**/uiBundles/**/vite-env.d.ts
**/uiBundles/**/vitest-env.d.ts
**/uiBundles/**/vitest.setup.ts
**/uiBundles/**/playwright.config.ts
**/uiBundles/**/eslint.config.js
**/uiBundles/**/components.json
**/uiBundles/**/codegen.yml
**/uiBundles/**/.graphqlrc.yml
**/uiBundles/**/.prettierrc
**/uiBundles/**/.prettierignore
**/uiBundles/**/CHANGELOG.md
**/uiBundles/**/README.md
**/uiBundles/**/index.html
**/uiBundles/**/.gitignore
**/uiBundles/**/.eslintrc*
**/uiBundles/**/.forceignore

# Generic noise
**/.DS_Store
**/node_modules/
**/.env
**/.env.local
